.IP \(bu 2
Hardware details (chip, GPU, memory)
.IP \(bu 2
Software information (OS, kernel, shell)
.IP \(bu 2
Display configuration and brightness
.IP \(bu 2
Battery status and system uptime
.IP \(bu 2
OS-specific ASCII logos

